WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,040
Carry on brother

2
00:00:03,540 --> 00:00:09,020
Is it still useful for me now?

3
00:00:09,620 --> 00:00:10,820
My sister is better than my brother

4
00:00:27,720 --> 00:00:29,220
Don't leave me

5
00:00:29,620 --> 00:00:32,320
My wife is still waiting for me at home. I'm dead.

6
00:00:32,520 --> 00:00:33,720
Others will bully her

7
00:00:34,220 --> 00:00:36,320
Yes, I love you so much
